# mutgap_disp_settings_overwritten: The page's settings are guest-writable; the settings check puts the host's values back and counts each as a change. In state 2, with the guest's overwrite of colorSpace.redPrimary.x (+0x2c), greenPrimary.x (+0x34) or origin.x (+0x4c, u16) and a mode list identical to the page's, the state machine raises 12, bumps expectedAck and sets ackPending: one update each, acknowledged before the next.
